    "library.form.chaptersDetail": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个视频按章节（有内嵌章节用内嵌，没有按时长切成 3～12 段）各抓一张画面：条目页出「章节」横排、点一张从那里开始播，Infuse 等播放器也能按章节跳转。扫描后在后台低优先级生成，每个文件要定位读取若干次，网络挂载的大库介意读取量可关闭；关闭后已生成的图保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个视频按章节（有内嵌章节用内嵌，没有按时长切成 3～12 段）各抓一张画面：条目页出「章节」横排、点一张从那里开始播，Infuse 等播放器也能按章节跳转。扫描后在后台低优先级生成，每个文件要定位读取若干次，网络挂载的大库介意读取量可关闭；关闭后已生成的图保留。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture an image for each chapter (embedded chapters, or 3–12 segments by duration). The title page shows a chapter row; select an image to play from there, and players such as Infuse can jump by chapter. Images are generated after scans at low priority and each file is read several times, so large network libraries may turn this off. Existing images are kept when it is off."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Toggle detail."
    },
    "library.form.tmdbCollectionsDetail": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "《哈利·波特》《碟中谍》这类系列会在合集页自动成集，按上映顺序排列，还能看出你缺哪几部、一键去补。这只是展示偏好：关掉之后系列信息照常入库、NFO 里照常写，Kodi/Emby 那边不受影响，只是我们的合集页不再自动多出几十个系列；重新打开会把已有的补齐，不会重新刮削。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "《哈利·波特》《碟中谍》这类系列会在合集页自动成集，按上映顺序排列，还能看出你缺哪几部、一键去补。这只是展示偏好：关掉之后系列信息照常入库、NFO 里照常写，Kodi/Emby 那边不受影响，只是我们的合集页不再自动多出几十个系列；重新打开会把已有的补齐，不会重新刮削。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Series such as Harry Potter or Mission: Impossible appear as collections in release order, showing missing movies you can find in one click. This is only a display preference: series information is still stored and written to NFO files, so Kodi and Emby are unaffected; the collections page just stops adding series. Turning it back on fills them in without rescraping."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Toggle detail."
    },
    "library.form.localCollectionsDetail": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频旁的 NFO 里写了系列（<set>）的，会在合集页按系列自动成集。这只是展示偏好：关掉之后系列信息照常读取，只是合集页不再自动生成；重新打开会把已有的补齐。改了 NFO 之后，在库的 ⋯ 菜单里点「重新读取 NFO 与封面」生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频旁的 NFO 里写了系列（<set>）的，会在合集页按系列自动成集。这只是展示偏好：关掉之后系列信息照常读取，只是合集页不再自动生成；重新打开会把已有的补齐。改了 NFO 之后，在库的 ⋯ 菜单里点「重新读取 NFO 与封面」生效。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Series information (<set>) in the NFO beside each video creates collections automatically. This is only a display preference: series information is still read, but collections are no longer generated. Turning it back on fills them in. After editing NFO files, choose Read NFO and covers again from the library’s ⋯ menu."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Toggle detail."
    },
