    "library.reidentify.pinnedTail": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "。在这里改挂会记为人工身份、扫描不会再翻案，条目 NFO 里矛盾的 tmdbid 也会被一并改正；但目录名上的标记需要你自己改，否则下次整理/重扫的命名仍会带着旧 id。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "。在这里改挂会记为人工身份、扫描不会再翻案，条目 NFO 里矛盾的 tmdbid 也会被一并改正；但目录名上的标记需要你自己改，否则下次整理/重扫的命名仍会带着旧 id。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Reassigning here records a manual identification that scans will not override, and corrects conflicting tmdbid values in NFO files. Change the directory tag yourself, or the next organize or rescan will keep the old ID in names."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "After the emphasized phrase."
    },
