            "value": "与 Jellyfin Webhook 插件同一套模板变量：下游文档里「贴进 Jellyfin 插件」的模板可直接贴到下方，实现免适配接入。此格式不签名，鉴权用附加请求头。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 Jellyfin Webhook 插件同一套模板变量：下游文档里「贴进 Jellyfin 插件」的模板可直接贴到下方，实现免适配接入。此格式不签名，鉴权用附加请求头。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the same template variables as the Jellyfin Webhook plugin. Paste a template supplied for that plugin below to connect without adapting it. This format has no signature; use additional headers for authentication."
